```jsx
import Tooltip from '../components/Tooltip';

const MyComponent = () => {
  return (
    <TooltipProvider>
      <Tooltip title="This is a tooltip">
        <div>Hover over me</div>
      </Tooltip>
      {/* More components */}
    </TooltipProvider>
  );
};

export default MyComponent;
```

Now, when you hover over the `<div>Hover over me</div>`, the Tooltip will open, and when you move the mouse away, it will close. If you hover over another Tooltip, the previously opened Tooltip will close, and the new one will open.

